1
00:00:00,230 --> 00:00:03,600
(Sheldon:)Now, if you'll excuse me,
I have work to do.

2
00:00:04,101 --> 00:00:05,501
(Howard:)Can you believe this guy?

3
00:00:05,736 --> 00:00:07,996
(Leonard:)What I don't believe
is you tried to run him over.

4
00:00:08,238 --> 00:00:10,298
(Howard:)Oh, like you've never thought
of doing that.

5
00:00:11,642 --> 00:00:15,102
(Howard:)Don't hate me
just because I lived the dream.

6
00:00:16,613 --> 00:00:19,643
(Sheldon:)Hey, sweet ride.

7
00:00:22,286 --> 00:00:23,656
(Howard:)What are you doing in there?

8
00:00:23,854 --> 00:00:26,914
(Sheldon:)Just breaking in your new car.

9
00:00:29,426 --> 00:00:31,156
Stop that! You stop that!

10
00:00:31,361 --> 00:00:32,491
(Sheldon:)You know what they say.

11
00:00:32,729 --> 00:00:36,499
(Sheldon:)Revenge is a dish best served nude.

12
00:00:41,672 --> 00:00:44,042
- Hey, got a minute?
- Oh, of course, come in.

13
00:00:51,548 --> 00:00:54,608
(Sheldon:)This is an authentic Chinese throwing star,
and I must warn you...

14
00:00:54,818 --> 00:00:57,518
(Sheldon:)...I have seen many people throw them
in movies.

15
00:00:58,121 --> 00:01:01,061
(Raj:)Calm down. Howard has something
he wants to say to you.

